<% content_for :title, "Educational Support for Children & University Students" %>

<section class="brand-gradient text-white pt-28 pb-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4 relative z-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 uppercase">
      <span>Pillar 3 • Student Academic Shelter</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white">A Difficult Home Should Not Mean A Lost Future.</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-purple-100/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans font-light">
      Protecting children and youth from losing access to education—from primary and secondary school through university—when their families experience separation, divorce, or financial distress.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="py-20 bg-warm-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-plum-950">Why This Programme Exists</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          When parents go through bitter divorce, marital breakdown, or sudden abandonment, young dependents are frequently the invisible victims. School fees go unpaid, textbooks become unaffordable, and promising students are forced to drop out of primary, secondary, or university education.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
          The Connecting Hearts Educational Support Pillar steps in to bridge this critical gap. We partner directly with primary schools, secondary institutions, and higher learning centers to pay tuition fees, supply books, and ensure uninterrupted learning.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-warm-300">
          <img src="<%= image_path('child.png') %>" alt="Children & University Student Educational Support" class="w-full h-64 object-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-warm-300 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">Who Qualifies For Support?</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-charcoal-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-terracotta-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Children of single parents experiencing extreme economic hardship.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-terracotta-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Students whose parents are undergoing separation/divorce disputes resulting in abandoned tuition fees.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-terracotta-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Primary, secondary, and university scholars whose academic dreams are at risk due to family crisis.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Active University Sponsorship Feature Banner -->
    <div class="brand-gradient rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center relative z-10">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-3">
          <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-amber-200 text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Higher Education Milestone</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">Sponsoring Tomorrow's Leaders at University</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-purple-100/90 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Our educational mandate is holistic. We do not stop at primary and secondary schooling. <strong>We have already started training 3 children at the university level</strong>, taking full responsibility for their tertiary tuition and academic welfare so family breakdown never cuts short higher education dreams.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex justify-start lg:justify-end">
          <div class="bg-white/10 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 text-center w-full">
            <span class="block font-serif text-4xl font-extrabold text-amber-300">3 Scholars</span>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-100 font-semibold mt-1 block">Currently Training in University</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sponsorship CTA Grid -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 border border-warm-300 shadow-sm text-center space-y-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-plum-950">How You Can Help Keep A Student In School</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Support a student across primary, secondary, or university level through tuition grants, term sponsorships, or textbook funds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-warm-100 border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-plum-900">Primary & Secondary</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700">Covers school fees, exercise books, uniforms, and basic supplies for vulnerable primary and secondary pupils.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-plum-50 border border-plum-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-plum-900">University Sponsorship</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700">Funds tertiary tuition fees, course materials, and essential upkeep for university students facing financial hardship.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-warm-100 border border-warm-300 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-plum-900">Academic Partnerships</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700">Educational and tertiary institutions partnering with us to offer subsidized slots and scholarship mentorship.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
        <%= link_to "Sponsor A Student Today", new_donation_path(purpose: "Support a Student's Education"), class: "px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white bg-terracotta-600 hover:bg-terracotta-500 rounded-full shadow-md transition-all" %>
        <%= link_to "Request Student Educational Assistance", new_support_request_path(category: "Educational Support for Children"), class: "px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-plum-900 bg-warm-200 hover:bg-warm-300 rounded-full border border-warm-300 transition-all" %>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
